<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Powertel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Powertel started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Kurt Abkemeier initiated coverage of personal communications services company Powertel Inc with a market-performer rating.</p>
<p>-- earlier Morgan said it had initiated coverage of two other PCS companies: Omnipoint Corp, with a buy rating, and Western Wireless Corp, with a long-term buy rating.</p>
</text>
